1
00:01:45,067 --> 00:01:46,817
好了 集合
All right, gather round.

2
00:01:47,276 --> 00:01:51,651
我们今天的任务是要守护阿米特通讯塔基地的安全
Our mission today is to secure the launch site for the Amity Communications Tower.

3
00:01:51,984 --> 00:01:54,192
基地地点是一座废弃的尘晶矿山
The designated area is an abandoned Dust mine.

4
00:01:54,234 --> 00:01:56,359
自从矿山关闭后 戮兽就在此聚集
Since its closure, the Grimm have moved in.

5
00:01:56,651 --> 00:01:57,484
好消息是
The good news

6
00:01:57,526 --> 00:02:00,192
那些未被开采的尘晶也还在里面
is all that untouched Dust is still down there, too.

7
00:02:00,526 --> 00:02:01,942
科研队说他们将会需要这些尘晶
Science team says they'll need it

8
00:02:01,984 --> 00:02:03,526
来完成第一阶段的发射
for the first phase of their launch.

9
00:02:03,567 --> 00:02:05,276
我为之前的混乱
Apologies for the mess

10
00:02:05,317 --> 00:02:07,901
以及一直扣着你们的武器道歉
and for holding onto your weapons for so long.

11
00:02:08,151 --> 00:02:10,401
你们要求的升级 呃
The upgrades you requested were, uh,

12
00:02:10,442 --> 00:02:14,276
比我预期的要更高一些
well, they were more than I anticipated.

13
00:02:14,484 --> 00:02:17,026
擎天军方的猎人已经非常努力地
Atlas military Huntsmen are already hard at work

14
00:02:17,067 --> 00:02:18,817
在清理周边的冰原地带
clearing out the surrounding tundra.

15
00:02:19,026 --> 00:02:21,317
但侦察队发现了一头强大的灵鬼
But recon has identified a powerful Geist

16
00:02:21,401 --> 00:02:24,942
它避开了攻击 并带走了几条人命
that's managed to evade destruction and take several lives.

17
00:02:25,442 --> 00:02:27,067
在我们增援后
After we increased our numbers,

18
00:02:27,109 --> 00:02:29,942
那头灵鬼也不傻 逃回到了矿山内
the Geist were smart enough to retreat into the mine itself

19
00:02:30,484 --> 00:02:33,776
这说明它已经有些年龄了 而且非常危险
meaning it's old, and extremely dangerous.

20
00:02:34,401 --> 00:02:35,942
这就是我们的目标
This is our target.

21
00:02:36,359 --> 00:02:38,984
新装备应该符合你们的要求
Your new weapons and armor should be as requested,

22
00:02:39,234 --> 00:02:40,984
不过我也自作主张地
but I also took the liberty of

23
00:02:41,026 --> 00:02:44,359
复盘了你们在维特节联赛中的战斗影像
reviewing your combat footage from the Vytal Festival Tournament.

24
00:02:44,401 --> 00:02:47,859
我在你们装备的增强方面还有一些额外的小建议
There's some additional enhancements I'd like to suggest.

25
00:02:47,901 --> 00:02:51,817
噢 不过 就现在来说这些足够你们用了
Oh, but for now, these should serve you well enough.

26
00:02:51,984 --> 00:02:54,192
这座矿山也曾是个大迷宫
The mine was a labyrinth back in the day.

27
00:02:54,942 --> 00:02:56,734
里面有各种隧道以及密室
There's all sorts of tunnels and chambers

28
00:02:56,776 --> 00:02:57,984
这头灵鬼可以在里面肆意游走
the Geist can move between,

29
00:02:58,609 --> 00:03:00,151
所以 如果我们想要除掉它
so if we're gonna kill this thing,

30
00:03:00,192 --> 00:03:02,359
我们必须分头行动将其包围
we'll have to split up and corner it.

31
00:03:05,651 --> 00:03:08,984
埃隆伍德将军说 你们也经历过不少战斗了
General Ironwood says you've seen your fair share of combat.

32
00:03:09,609 --> 00:03:11,651
我可以将我的生命托付于他
I trust that man with my life,

33
00:03:12,109 --> 00:03:13,109
所以明天
so tomorrow,

34
00:03:13,317 --> 00:03:15,359
我也会同样地去信任你们
I'll be trusting you all, too.

35
00:03:16,942 --> 00:03:19,234
嘿 Ruby?
Hey, Ruby?

36
00:03:26,901 --> 00:03:28,567
一起实现目标吧 筒子们
Let's make it happen, people.

37
00:03:31,859 --> 00:03:32,192
嗯!
Hmm!

38
00:03:34,109 --> 00:03:34,692
哇哦!
Oh!

39
00:04:18,942 --> 00:04:21,234
这是我最爱的部分
This is my favorite part.

40
00:04:36,276 --> 00:04:40,317
哈哈 或许你们这帮小屁孩不会把自己玩儿死哦
Perhaps you kids won't get yourselves killed after all.

41
00:04:41,026 --> 00:04:41,942
哼!
Hmph!

42
00:04:41,984 --> 00:04:44,026
她其实是在夸你们
she meant that as a compliment

43
00:04:48,442 --> 00:04:49,401
这里是阿尔法小队
This is Alpha squad

44
00:04:49,442 --> 00:04:51,901
着陆区无异常 即将徒步前进
LZ's clear, proceeding on foot.

45
00:04:51,942 --> 00:04:53,942
你们手上都有新的高科技卷轴
You've all got fancy new scrolls,

46
00:04:53,984 --> 00:04:55,234
记得好好利用
so don't forget to use 'em.

47
00:04:55,276 --> 00:04:56,901
眼观六路 耳听八方
Keep your eyes and ears open.

48
00:04:56,942 --> 00:04:59,026
如果遇到目标 记得及时向我汇报
I want an update if you encounter the target.

49
00:04:59,109 --> 00:04:59,984
阿尔法 完毕
Alpha out.

50
00:05:01,151 --> 00:05:01,276
嗯?
Huh?

51
00:05:02,151 --> 00:05:06,401
啊 抱歉 只是还没习惯你的新发型
Uh, sorry, just not used to the new hair yet.

52
00:05:07,317 --> 00:05:08,901
难看吗?
Is it bad?

53
00:05:08,984 --> 00:05:11,567
不不不 好看 超好看的!
No, no, it's good, great even!

54
00:05:11,609 --> 00:05:14,234
啧 我可不是来当保姆的
Man, I did not sign up to be a babysitter.

55
00:05:14,442 --> 00:05:17,692
我们其他人不也日常跟个保姆一样照顾你吗
Yeah, well, the rest of us babysit you all the time.

56
00:05:18,151 --> 00:05:18,817
哼!
Hmph!

57
00:05:24,276 --> 00:05:25,067
呃
Hmm.

58
00:05:35,151 --> 00:05:37,609
这里也太冷了!
Oh, it's freezing out here!

59
00:05:37,651 --> 00:05:39,901
如果没有暖气或元气投影
Without heating or projected Aura,

60
00:05:39,942 --> 00:05:42,692
幽影大陆的低温可以在几小时内将人冻死
the cold of Solitas can kill you in a matter of hours.

61
00:05:42,734 --> 00:05:45,609
我突然不觉得把奥斯卡留下是对不起他了
I suddenly don't feel as bad about leaving Oscar behind.

62
00:05:46,442 --> 00:05:48,609
我们可以再谈谈这事儿吗?
Can we talk about that again?

63
00:05:50,776 --> 00:05:51,984
谈什么呢?
What about it?

64
00:05:52,484 --> 00:05:55,109
我们真的不把奥兹的实情告诉埃隆伍德吗?
We're really not gonna tell Ironwood what happened to Oz?

65
00:05:55,317 --> 00:05:57,942
关于我们知道的有关灯神和塞伦的事?
What we learned about Jinn, about Salem?

66
00:05:57,984 --> 00:06:01,234
我们会的 总有一天
We are, we will,

67
00:06:01,651 --> 00:06:04,067
但你也看到我们刚到擎天时的状况了
but you saw how things looked when we flew into Atlas.

68
00:06:04,151 --> 00:06:06,359
现在看来 将军的意愿是好的
The General's heart seems to be in the right place,

69
00:06:06,401 --> 00:06:08,609
但这不表示我们可以完全信任他
but that doesn't mean we should trust him yet.

70
00:06:08,776 --> 00:06:12,192
在做任何重大决定前 我们需要先见机行事
We need to play along for a while before we make any major decisions.

71
00:06:12,734 --> 00:06:15,901
好吧 奥斯卡又怎么看呢?
Okay, how did Oscar feel about that?

72
00:06:18,317 --> 00:06:20,276
把古老圣物随身带着到处乱跑
Er, probably shouldn't keep running around

73
00:06:20,317 --> 00:06:22,692
好像不怎么明智 对吧?
with an ancient relic on a keychain, you know?

74
00:06:24,442 --> 00:06:25,192
但是
But -

75
00:06:25,234 --> 00:06:27,276
我知道你一定会在擎天保证它的安全
I know you'll keep it safe in Atlas.

76
00:06:27,442 --> 00:06:29,817
Ruby 对埃隆伍德隐瞒状况
Ruby, hiding things from Ironwood,

77
00:06:30,567 --> 00:06:32,817
这不就像是奥兹平对我们做的事一样吗?
doesn't that feel like what Ozpin did to us?

78
00:06:37,776 --> 00:06:38,901
说实话
Gotta say,

79
00:06:39,234 --> 00:06:41,901
我还是不大习惯跟别的猎人一起干活
I'm still not really used to working with other Huntsmen in the field.

80
00:06:41,942 --> 00:06:44,192
但你以前不也曾在一支小队里战斗吗?
But you were on a team before, weren't you?

81
00:06:45,151 --> 00:06:46,609
陈年旧事了
Long time ago.

82
00:06:47,026 --> 00:06:49,734
我只是发现一个人做事是最好的
I just found working alone tends to be for the best.

83
00:06:49,776 --> 00:06:51,359
我觉得这想法有些可悲
Well, I think that's a shame.

84
00:06:52,317 --> 00:06:52,859
噢!
Oh!

85
00:06:56,984 --> 00:06:58,901
这里是阿尔法 告诉我你们的状况
Alpha here, gimme an update.

86
00:06:58,942 --> 00:07:01,067
连接的冰窟似乎没有异常
The connecting ice tunnels seem clear.

87
00:07:01,484 --> 00:07:04,567
我们很快就要到达尘晶矿藏内了
We should be approaching the actual mine any minute now.

88
00:07:04,901 --> 00:07:06,692
太令人激动了!
This is so exciting!

89
00:07:06,734 --> 00:07:09,234
我们像真正的猎人小队一样!
It feels like we're an actual Huntsmen team!

90
00:07:09,776 --> 00:07:13,276
我 呃 Ren 喜欢你的新造型哦
I, um, like what you did with your outfit, Ren

91
00:07:13,317 --> 00:07:16,234
我们还是把注意力集中在任务上比较好
We should probably stay focused on the mission.

92
00:07:18,151 --> 00:07:19,651
噢 好吧
Oh, okay.

93
00:07:20,442 --> 00:07:21,942
我也喜欢你的新造型哦
like your outfit, too

94
00:07:22,359 --> 00:07:22,817
哼

95
00:07:22,984 --> 00:07:24,276
这里是B队
Bravo checking in.

96
00:07:24,567 --> 00:07:26,234
我们遇到了些障碍
Hit a bit of a snag.

97
00:07:26,567 --> 00:07:28,401
主入口处有塌方
There's been a cave-in in the main entrance.

98
00:07:28,442 --> 00:07:29,692
不知道是近期新形成的
Not sure if it's recent

99
00:07:29,734 --> 00:07:31,651
还是源自当年的事故
or was caused by the original accident.

100
00:07:31,692 --> 00:07:34,317
总之 我们得解决这点麻烦
Either way, we'll have to do a little problem solving.

101
00:07:34,567 --> 00:07:37,276
明白 有需求就告诉我们
Understood, let us know if you need anything.

102
00:07:37,901 --> 00:07:38,817
你还好吗?
You okay?

103
00:07:39,151 --> 00:07:41,276
我刚意识到我们在哪了
I just realized where we are.

104
00:07:41,984 --> 00:07:44,276
这个矿井是在爆炸后关闭的
This mine was closed after an explosion.

105
00:07:44,859 --> 00:07:46,859
我记得这场灾难
I remember this disaster,

106
00:07:47,734 --> 00:07:51,734
准确的说 是我记得父亲当时多么愤怒
or rather, I remember how furious it made my father.

107
00:07:52,942 --> 00:07:56,442
我真希望我能把我家带给弗纳人的痛苦带走
I wish I could take back the years of pain my family has caused the Faunus,

108
00:07:56,859 --> 00:07:58,984
顺带我的自满自负
and all of my complacency in it.

109
00:08:00,359 --> 00:08:02,859
这个社会让弗纳人成为底层
This society is set up for Faunus to be at the bottom,

110
00:08:02,901 --> 00:08:05,109
而人类们乐于坐视不管
and humans are willing participants.

111
00:08:05,151 --> 00:08:07,401
他们靠忽略我们的需求来坐享其成
They benefit from doing nothing to help us.

112
00:08:07,442 --> 00:08:10,026
还有些人积极地虐待我们
But there are still those who actively abuse us.

113
00:08:11,234 --> 00:08:14,734
不过 我也不是来这里解决体制问题的
Anyway, I didn't come over here looking to solve systemic societal issues.

114
00:08:14,776 --> 00:08:18,109
哈里特发现了条小道 能让你们其中一人通过
Harriet found a gap in the rubble we think one of you could fit through

115
00:08:18,317 --> 00:08:21,192
有夜视本领的人就很理想?
ideally someone with a knack for seeing in the dark?

116
00:08:22,692 --> 00:08:24,276
哦 当然
Oh, of course.

117
00:08:34,401 --> 00:08:36,609
Blake 看看四周
All right, Blake, take a look around.

118
00:08:38,067 --> 00:08:40,026
附近有没有尘晶?
Is there any Dust in the immediate area?

119
00:08:40,692 --> 00:08:45,317
矿车 残骸 不过没有尘晶
Mine carts... debris...no Dust, though.

120
00:08:45,359 --> 00:08:47,776
好 那应该可以安全地炸出通道来让我们过去
Great, then it should be safe to blast our way through.

121
00:08:48,234 --> 00:08:50,067
行 这就回
Okay, heading back.

122
00:08:51,984 --> 00:08:53,984
该死 Blake 后退
Damn it, Blake, stand back.

123
00:08:59,984 --> 00:09:01,109
别让它跑了!
Don't let it get away!

124
00:09:21,151 --> 00:09:22,651
真恶心
That's disgusting.

125
00:10:01,026 --> 00:10:01,817
待着
Stay.

126
00:10:10,151 --> 00:10:11,651
这 里是B队 我们找到目标了
This is Bravo, we found the target,

127
00:10:11,692 --> 00:10:14,026
但它逃到矿井深处了 我们正在和百足魔蚣交战
but it fled deeper into the mine. Engaging Centinels.

128
00:10:14,067 --> 00:10:15,359
我们搞快点!
Let's pick up the pace!

129
00:10:22,734 --> 00:10:23,401
遇敌
Contact!

130
00:10:42,151 --> 00:10:45,567
真是种... 头铁的打法
A very... head-first approach.

131
00:10:46,526 --> 00:10:49,734
这算是我们的风格吧
Yeah, well, that's just kind of our style.

132
00:10:55,151 --> 00:10:55,817
还有一头!
One left!

133
00:10:56,442 --> 00:10:57,567
我来
I got it.

134
00:11:02,484 --> 00:11:06,901
哇 你的外像力让你跑得比谁都快 像我一样!
Whoa, your Semblance makes you super fast, just like me!

135
00:11:06,942 --> 00:11:09,984
挺酷的嘛 不过看你的反应时间
Very cool, though based on your reaction time,

136
00:11:10,026 --> 00:11:11,859
我觉得还是我快一些
I'd say I'm a little faster.

137
00:11:11,901 --> 00:11:14,109
这里是阿尔法 我们已经与目标接触
This is Alpha, we've engaged the target.

138
00:11:18,151 --> 00:11:20,067
所有队伍向我们的位置集合
All squads head towards our position.

139
00:11:44,901 --> 00:11:45,859
等等 停下!
Wait, stop!

140
00:11:53,901 --> 00:11:57,692
可恶 目标逃脱 最后目击往东去了
Darn it, target escaped, last seen headed east.

141
00:11:58,276 --> 00:11:59,609
感谢提醒
Thanks for the call-out.

142
00:11:59,776 --> 00:12:01,151
不然后果难料
That could have been bad.

143
00:12:03,026 --> 00:12:04,526
可别谢我
I wouldn't thank me.

144
00:12:05,317 --> 00:12:07,359
我外像力会带来厄运
My Semblance brings misfortune.

145
00:12:07,692 --> 00:12:09,984
有时候我无法控制它
Sometimes I can't keep it under control.

146
00:12:10,526 --> 00:12:11,317
这样啊
That so?

147
00:12:14,692 --> 00:12:17,109
别妄自菲薄
Well, hey, don't beat yourself up about it.

148
00:12:23,567 --> 00:12:25,567
我的外像力是好运
My Semblance is good fortune.

149
00:12:26,026 --> 00:12:27,192
你真幸运
Lucky you, huh?

150
00:12:29,276 --> 00:12:32,901
C队B队 你们应该能在矿山中心拦下目标
Charlie, Bravo, you should be able to cut off the target at the heart of the mine.

151
00:12:32,942 --> 00:12:35,109
克罗和我很快会跟上
Qrow and I won't be far behind.

152
00:12:49,901 --> 00:12:50,567
大家
Guys!

153
00:12:50,776 --> 00:12:52,067
所有人小心
Everyone use caution.

154
00:12:52,109 --> 00:12:54,609
这个空间充满了活化的尘晶能量
This room is highly active with Dust energy.

155
00:12:54,651 --> 00:12:56,776
如果触发爆炸会毁掉发射台
Triggering it could ruin the launch site.

156
00:12:57,151 --> 00:12:58,817
并把我们蒸发
And vaporize us.

157
00:12:58,859 --> 00:13:00,901
你怎么总是任务优先?
How is that always second with you?

158
00:13:01,692 --> 00:13:03,692
我以为那目标应该已经在这里了
I thought the target was supposed to be in here.

159
00:13:18,276 --> 00:13:19,984
它往躯体上添加了尘晶?
It added Dust to its body?

160
00:13:20,567 --> 00:13:21,734
我们要怎么--
How are we supposed to --

161
00:13:24,567 --> 00:13:25,109
埃姆!
Elm!

162
00:13:35,067 --> 00:13:36,026
瓦因!
Vine!

163
00:13:43,442 --> 00:13:44,401
马罗!
Marrow!

164
00:13:53,026 --> 00:13:53,817
哈里特!
Harriet!

165
00:14:12,151 --> 00:14:12,901
淦!
Crap!

166
00:14:16,734 --> 00:14:18,734
没有我你们该怎么办啊?
What would you guys do without me?

167
00:15:08,234 --> 00:15:08,984
哈里特
Harriet!

168
00:15:21,026 --> 00:15:22,859
记得你说过你的外像力和我的很像?
Thought you said your Semblance was like mine.

169
00:15:23,401 --> 00:15:25,401
不是吗?
It is?

170
00:15:25,442 --> 00:15:27,817
我以前见过其他神速者
I've seen other speed Semblances before,

171
00:15:28,192 --> 00:15:30,609
但你的不一样
but that was different.

172
00:15:30,651 --> 00:15:32,609
我想你的外像力另有内情
I think there's more going on than you think.

173
00:15:32,859 --> 00:15:35,109
真期待她看到Ruby施展银瞳时的神情
Wait until she sees what she can do with her eyes.

174
00:15:38,567 --> 00:15:39,901
幸运一接哈?
Lucky catch, huh?

175
00:15:39,942 --> 00:15:43,234
并不 我会管那叫天分
Hmm, no, I'd chalk that one up to talent.

176
00:15:44,317 --> 00:15:48,401
擎天指挥中心 这里是克洛弗 任务完成
Atlas Control, this is Clover. Mission accomplished.

177
00:15:51,609 --> 00:15:53,567
谢谢你的顺风车
Yeah, thanks for the lift!

178
00:16:10,026 --> 00:16:13,109
